  <main_text>
    <l n="1" type="heading" level="1" para="true">EXPLICATIO TABULÆ</l>
    <l n="2" para="true">Libri titulo præfixæ, Eruditionis</l>
    <l n="3">triplicis imaginem repræsentantis,</l>
    <l n="4" type="heading" level="2" para="true">Ad SPECTATOREM.</l>
    <l n="5" para="true">
      <i>SEcurus Eruditionis qui cupis</i>
    </l>
    <l n="6">
      <i>Inire semitam, viarum quas petis</i>
    </l>
    <l n="7">
      <i>Hic indicem ducemque tabulam videns,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8">
      <i>Attende muta quæ loquatur pagina:</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9" para="true">
      <i>Caverna multis quam tenebris obsitam</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10">
      <i>Tantâ celebrem confpicis frequentiâ,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="11">
      <i>Hæc ERUDITIONIS est FALSÆ</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12">
      <i>domus, Præjudiciorum tecta densis nebulis,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13">
      <i>Queis fascinati, qui videntur, hospites</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14">
      <i>Omnes ad unum turgidas vento levi</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15">
      <i>Conflare bullas vel docentur vel docent.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16">
      <i>Cave librorum ne strues fucum tibi</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17">
      <i>Titulis superbis faciat, aut te schematum</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18">
      <i>Contagiosa fascinent præstigia.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19">
      <i>Nil hic latet quam quæstionum putidæ</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20">
      <i>Spina, &amp; chimæræ somniorum, quæ fere</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21">
      <i>Minus juvant aranearum stamine,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22">
      <i>Ovisque vel serpentis haud minus nocent.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="23">
      <i>Abrupta quæ sequuntur montis ardui</i>
    </l>
    <l n="24">
      <i>Sterilisque, vix uni vel alteri gradu</i>
    </l>
    <l n="25">
      <i>Tentata dubio, (namque &amp; in præceps</i>
    </l>
    <l n="26">
      <i>ruunt, Abyssus ingens &amp; ruentes excipit)</i>
    </l>
    <l n="27">
      <i>Provinciam scias SUPERFICIARIÆ</i>
    </l>
    <l n="28">
      <i>Esse ERUDITIONIS, in viam nimis,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="29" para="true">
      <i>Pau-</i>
    </l>
  </main_text>
  <notes>The verse block has a decorative initial S. The printed text contains "Securus" with the initial S joined. Right margin has faint marks and a small Google watermark, not transcribed. The word "domus" is partly italic and partly in the roman word "FALSÆ"; transcribed as printed. Lower margin text ("Google") is a digitiser's mark and omitted.</notes>
